00:03:08.260 --> 00:03:10.030
and some of the challenges

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:12.300
and frankly, ugliness associated with that

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:14.820
which we really emphasize in episode one.

00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:17.950
I know for me, as I talked to
