00:03:17.950 --> 00:03:19.300
as I interacted with my students,

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:21.460
as I talked to people in the community,

00:03:21.460 --> 00:03:22.750
as I talked to people in faith communities

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:24.530
and church communities, it's
really kind of this element

00:03:24.530 --> 00:03:27.620
of tiredness and really wanting
to be able to move through

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:28.870
and move forward even though

00:03:28.870 --> 00:03:31.030
there's still work we have to do.

00:03:31.030 --> 00:03:32.880
So I know there's a lot
