00:28:34.890 --> 00:28:37.529
That embracing the pain
in a way that you know

00:28:37.529 --> 00:28:40.083
that you can get through
it and you can recover.

00:28:41.260 --> 00:28:45.860
often when a player gets
injured in sports, for example

00:28:47.500 --> 00:28:51.190
I kind of go back to when
I had surgery a few times

00:28:51.190 --> 00:28:55.640
