through that process,

00:28:55.640 --> 00:28:56.790
the healing, the recovery,

00:28:56.790 --> 00:29:00.420
but oftentimes you come
back smarter, wiser

00:29:00.420 --> 00:29:02.107
you learn from it.

00:29:02.107 --> 00:29:04.110
And the other thing that
I like what you said

00:29:04.110 --> 00:29:07.693
cause it's about don't run from pain,

00:29:08.760 --> 00:29:10.669
it's almost like, we know a lot of people

00:29:10.669 --> 00:29:14.744
who may have an injury or
ailment and you're like,

00:29:14.744 --> 00:29:16.560
I'm okay, I'm good, I'm good.

00:29:16.560 --> 00:29:19.950
Well, that's one thing
between playing tough

00:29:19.950 --> 00:29:22.350
but then another thing is being smart.

00:29:22.350 --> 00:29:24.240
And if you ignore that pain,

00:29:24.240 --> 00:29:26.810
which I think is given to us too,

00:29:26.810 --> 00:29:28.963
it's hey, there's something going on here.

00:29:30.460 --> 00:29:33.180
It should be something
you pay attention to

00:29:33.180 --> 00:29:35.333
you don't dwell on it, sit in it

00:29:35.333 --> 00:29:38.120
think about it, but you
do something about it

00:29:38.120 --> 00:29:40.457
you notice it, and then you recover.

00:29:40.457 --> 00:29:43.120
And when do, you start to understand

00:29:43.120 --> 00:29:44.585
that this pain actually helped me

00:29:44.585 --> 00:29:47.560
and I can always recover.

00:29:47.560 --> 00:29:50.460
I think that's the one thing
that I always think about is,

00:29:51.310 --> 00:29:53.569
when a person gets injured in sports,

00:29:53.569 --> 00:29:56.880
you know that especially nowadays

00:29:56.880 --> 00:30:01.880
with the medical advancements,
you're gonna recover

00:30:02.700 --> 00:30:04.963
