license to keep us in pain.

00:32:21.460 --> 00:32:23.260
And that's hard, I know it's tough,

00:32:23.260 --> 00:32:28.260
but if we dwell on why it happened,

00:32:30.330 --> 00:32:34.210
who made it happen, that
becomes unhealthy in itself.

00:32:34.210 --> 00:32:36.420
And I think that's where
I think faith comes in

00:32:36.420 --> 00:32:40.280
is like look, we have
to learn to not dwell

00:32:40.280 --> 00:32:43.840
on why it happened, who made it happen,

00:32:43.840 --> 00:32:46.633
but the fact that we can get through it.

00:32:47.993 --> 00:32:51.760
- And how do we get through it?

00:32:51.760 --> 00:32:52.783
Stay with that.

00:32:55.800 --> 00:32:57.940
Now, that's important, I agree with you.

00:32:57.940 --> 00:33:00.870
And unfortunately, because we are so wired

00:33:00.870 --> 00:33:05.870
to sort of say, well, I can
look weak in facing this.

00:33:06.440 --> 00:33:11.241
That is another big
social construct out there

00:33:11.241 --> 00:33:13.760
and you take it in your
stride and if you don't,

00:33:13.760 --> 00:33:18.070
then you are somehow you're lesser than.

00:33:18.070 --> 00:33:19.990
We have a lot of things out there

00:33:19.990 --> 00:33:24.090
that get people out of
pain perhaps in the moment,

00:33:24.090 --> 00:33:25.810
or they think they get them out of pain

00:33:25.810 --> 00:33:30.310
and it just creates more
difficulties later on.

00:33:30.310 --> 00:33:34.777
And so that that made things complicated.

00:33:34.777 --> 00:33:37.512
- Yeah, so I said, that
ties back even to what Allan

00:33:37.512 --> 00:33:40.570
I know you mentioned the
